  "title": "Claude 账号被封之后，怎么样去申请退款？",
  "author": "",
  "authorAvatar": "",
  "tags": [],
  "content": "<div>大家好，今天很不幸发现 claude 账号被封了。</div>\n<div>之前一直用的家宽 IP，稳定使用了好几个月了。今天因为注册别的账号切换了一下IP，没想到立马就给封了。</div>\n<div>有点可惜，虽然之前备份过一次聊天记录。但是还是有些聊天记录没来得及去备份，随着账号被封全部都没有了。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jbub3a2i6n_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>哎，没办法，anthropic 这家公司就是这么狗，反🌸，技术垄断，真不希望这样的公司最终一家独大。</div>\n<div>OpenAI、Google 加点油啊。御三家最有好感的就是 Google 了，希望 Google 大模型加油，尽早发挥生态优势。</div>\n<div>话虽这样说，现阶段还离不开 claude，重新注册一个账号，又是一条好汉。</div>\n<div>不过后面应该不会使用 claude 网页版了，所有的聊天都在本地 CLI 上使用，这样可以写一个脚本定时归档聊天记录到本地硬盘。就不用担心聊天记录再丢失了。</div>\n<div><strong>下面说正事，claude 账号被封之后，怎么去申请退款？</strong></div>\n<div>我是用苹果礼品卡买的 claude，所以下面分享的也是这种方法。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1、苹果官方网站报告问题</h3>\n<div>网站地址：</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://reportaproblem.apple.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://reportaproblem.apple.com/</a></div>\n<div>因为我们是用苹果礼品卡付的钱，但是订阅期限还没到就被封号了，所以我们直接去找苹果。</div>\n<div>让他退款，那么他就会去找 anthropic 核实，核实无误之后就会退款给我们。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2、登录账号</h3>\n<div>这里登录的是美区账号，别登错了。登国区账号的话是看不到你的订单的</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3、信息填写</h3>\n<div>选择「请求退款」和「其他」，然后点下一步</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jbub3a2i6n_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">4、选择你需要退款的订单，然后点击下一步</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jbub3a2i6n_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">5、补充详细信息</h3>\n<div>写清楚，什么时间，Anthropic 无故封禁了我的账号，导致我无法使用应有的订阅服务</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jbub3a2i6n_img4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>用的话，时间日期改成你自己的：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-Plain\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>On January 27, 2026, Anthropic suspended my account without explanation, even though my subscription doesn’t expire until January 30, 2026. Since today is only the 27th, I’m requesting a refund for the unused portion.</span></code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">6、提交等待退款</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jbub3a2i6n_img5.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">7、结果</h3>\n<div>亲测已经成功退款\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/jbub3a2i6n_img6.png\" alt=\"5556666.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
